  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "New thresholds",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Contract award and implementation",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN applies to all contracting authorities, as defined by the UK regulations. This includes all central government departments, their executive agencies, non-departmental public bodies and other public sector organisations (collectively referred to as ‘in-scope organisations’).",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN sets out the thresholds that apply from 1 January 2024 for the purposes of determining the application of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (PCR 2015), the Utilities Contracts Regulations 2016, the Concession Contracts Regulations 2016 and the Defence and Security Public Contracts Regulations 2011 to the award of contracts for goods, works and services.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "These thresholds, which are set out at Annex A of this PPN (i.e. PPN 11/23), differ depending on the type of contract awarded (whether in relation to goods, works or services) and the applicable procurement legislation. For contracts awarded under PCR 2015, the applicable threshold also differs depending on whether the contract is awarded by central government contracting authorities or sub-central contracting authorities. The thresholds are provided inclusive of VAT.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Above-threshold contracts must comply with the substantive requirements of Part 2 PCR 2015.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In-scope organisations should, as a matter of principle:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that a contract subject to Part 2 PCR 2015 is advertised accordingly by publishing a contract award notice.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PPN should be read alongside the relevant parts of the legal framework, including but not limited to, the following provisions of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (which may be particularly relevant to the consideration of this PPN):",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 5: Threshold amounts",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 5A: Review and amendment of certain thresholds",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 6: Methods for calculating the estimated value of procurement",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "New thresholds",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
